DTSTAMP:20260904T123534Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261001
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261002
SUMMARY:Deadline: The Supporting Act Foundation: Artist Grant 2026 (10 x EU
 R 10\,000)
DESCRIPTION:The Supporting Act Foundation's Artist Grant supports emerging 
 artists from underrepresented groups whose practices involve collaborative
 \, collective\, or creative processes that incorporate or benefit their co
 mmunity\, aiming to improve artists' living conditions\, buy time for prac
 tice development\, increase visibility\, and build confidence. AWARD: 10 u
 nrestricted grants of EUR 10\,000\, transferred in monthly installments of
  EUR 1\,000. ELIGIBILITY: emerging artists with at least 2 and no more tha
 n 10 years of professional experience\, born in or before 2005\, who ident
 ify as belonging to an underrepresented group or as consistently facing sy
 stemic barriers to equal opportunities in the creative industries in their
  country\; based in Belgium\, France\, Germany\, Greece\, Ireland\, Italy\
 , the Netherlands\, Portugal\, Spain\, or the UK with a personal IBAN acco
 unt there\; with an up-to-date website or public social profile sharing th
 eir work. Applicants must outline how the grant will support their artisti
 c development and help overcome economic\, social\, cultural\, physical\, 
 or health-related barriers\, and be willing to be an active ambassador for
  the TSAF Grantee Network. Former and current TSAF grantees are not eligib
 le. DEADLINE: 1 October 2026\, 11:00AM CET.\n\nOrganisation: The Supportin
 g Act Foundation (TSAF)\nLocation: For emerging artists based in Belgium\,
  France\, Germany\, Greece\, Ireland\, Italy\, the Netherlands\, Portugal\
 , Spain\, or the United Kingdom\, with a personal IBAN bank account in one
  of those countries.\nAward: 10 unrestricted grants of EUR 10\,000 each\, 
 paid in monthly installments of EUR 1\,000. No application fee.\nDuration:
  Grant paid out over 10 monthly installments.\n\nMore: https://thesupporti
 ngact.org/programs/artist-grant/2026?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk
 &utm_medium=referral
URL:https://thesupportingact.org/programs/artist-grant/2026?utm_source=arti
 ficialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:For emerging artists based in Belgium\, France\, Germany\, Greece\
 , Ireland\, Italy\, the Netherlands\, Portugal\, Spain\, or the United Kin
 gdom\, with a personal IBAN bank account in one of those countries.
END:VEVENT
